      "criterion": "equivalence",
      "problem": "'急诊' means the emergency room or emergency department, so the label presents the number as an ER line. The English means 'for an emergency': it is the number where the patient asks for the on-call Otolaryngology resident (call.08, which says 如有紧急情况).",
      "suggestion": "紧急情况"
    },
